    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp\u003eThe primary objective of this system is to ensure the correct conclusion of the billing process. The billing procedure will take into consideration data derived from contracts and orders. Consequently, both of these components are essential for the correct execution of the process. To create a contract or an order, it is mandatory to define its parameters in accordance with the product, service, and goods objects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe process of creating penalties within Bundle 2 combines a structured approach that aims the systematic gathering of essential information. This information is crucial for accurately determining the penalty amount applicable to the customer, either at the contract or order level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe penalty object combines various fields that serve to precisely define the penalty amount and its associated terms:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eName:\u003c/strong\u003e this fields is mandatory and requires the information regarding to the penalty object.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContract clause number:\u003c/strong\u003e this element is used to specify the contract to which the penalty will be applied.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eParty receiving the penalty\u003c/strong\u003e: this field is mandatory as it necessitated the identification of the party responsible for incurring the penalty, whether it be the customer or ENERGO-PRO.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplicability:\u003c/strong\u003e mandatory for selection and this field determines the level at which the penalty is to be established. If it is created at the contract level, the Point of Deliveries (PODs) are automatically included in the process. Conversely, if the penalty pertains exclusively to the PODs, it need not to be created at the contract level. If it is generated for a specific event, the system will charge the customer as per the defined event.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAmount\u003c/strong\u003e: this field allows users to define the penalty amount using predefined formulas. The system also offers the flexibility to set minimum and maximum penalty amounts, along with specifying the associated currency. Additional information can be provided as needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment terms:\u003c/strong\u003e this field is compulsory and entails the definition of payment terms associated with the penalty. These payment terms may involve unique calculation logics, such as excluding weekends or considering only calendar days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo interest on overdue debts:\u003c/strong\u003e if this checkbox is selected, it signifies that the definition of payment term parameters is not possible, and the system will not generate interest for overdue debts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDuring penalty creation:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen creating a penalty, completion of all required fields is mandatory.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter clicking the \u0027Create\u0027 button, the system should check frontend validation, and if an error is detected, it should be displayed in the proper field.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the event of a backend error (after successful frontend validation), the system also displays an error message.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDuring penalty editing:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePenalty does not include versioning functionality and only one version of the penalty should be created.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf a penalty is already included in a contract or order, editing without \u0027Edit Locked\u0027 permission is not possible.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to change all the fields parameters in the editing mode.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eCopy functionality:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe penalty includes a copy functionality, accessible during both the creation and editing modes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDuring the creation and edit mode, it\u0027s possible to select a desired penalty to create a new penalty. This allows for the duplication of a penalty with the ability to modify its parameters. In case of any errors, the system promptly provides error notifications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf an object contains inactive nomenclature, while coping that object should not be copied.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
                                 "representation":  "storage",
